                    "source": "PubMed",
                    "id": "16357133"
                  }
                ],
                "value": "Shuttles between the nucleus and cytoplasm (By similarity). Predominantly nuclear under normal growth conditions, and when phosphorylated at Ser-457 (PubMed:16357133)"
              }
